<title>USA: Pioneer begins tender, to issue new debt.</title>
<headline>Pioneer begins tender, to issue new debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pioneer Cos Inc on Tuesday said its Pioneer Americas Acquisition Corp unit has commenced a cash tender offer to purchase its $135 million outstanding 13-3/8 percent first mortgage notes due 2005.</p>
<p>Pioneer said the tender offer and $102.5 million acquisition of Occidental Chemical Corp chlor-alkali plant in Tacoma, Wash. will be financed with private issue of new senior secured notes, or other debt securities.</p>
</text>
